# UI controls bottom capture: force the Controls tab to its final rows so clipped text cannot escape the window.
seed 4242
physics off
text off
vsync off
water_hidden on
terrain_hidden on
frames 24
ui tab controls
ui rect 64 70 430 280
ui scroll bottom
ui blur on
ui renderer_combo closed
ui mouse 120 300
ui profiler_expand none
ui_test_pattern off
screenshot Profile/ui_controls_bottom.bmp frame 20

camera main 500 60 650  600 33 600  0 1 0
